IN-LINE FIX BEFORE THIS INVOCATION (tester, within the test; Test Engineer: "fix the issue in-line and re-run it")
  Cause (run3): TestSet configure() -> createFlashBootImages() copies mainrelease.rel and backuprelease.rel to flash;
  with the baseline flash:/x230v2_28GS-tb470.rel still there, 95.6 MB flash holds only two 36.5 MB releases, so
  backuprelease.rel failed "% Destination file system out of space" (logged, not FAILed). On 10-06 the 2001 TestSet's
  configure had already deleted *.rel. Fix: take the baseline release off flash before each invocation while the
  TFTP bootloader default keeps u0 bootable; it is copied back at the group restore.
